*.model
*.miniann
sandbox_model*
/*_loss.csv
/*loss.csv
training_loss.csv
circles_*.csv
/*_report.html

# Private local-only notes (never commit: personal runbook/summary)
MY_NOTES.md
MY_NOTES*.md
PRIVATE*.md
private*.md

# Local-only discussion / viva notes (not part of build, do not commit)
docs/CLI_HTML_REPORT_SUMMARY.md
CLI_HTML_REPORT_SUMMARY.md
docs/*SUMMARY*.md
docs/*NOTES*.md

# Keep dataset inputs under data/
!data/*.csv

